OL,3,GNEWSAFather and son jailed for dragging
OL,4,A'terrified' police officer along road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father and son who attempted to
OL,7,Fmurder a police officer by dragging him
OL,8,Falong a road have been jailed.
OL,10,FDouglas Mills, 58, and Douglas Mills
OL,11,FJnr, 32, sped off in an Audi after PC
OL,12,FMark Smith approached them over a
OL,13,Fsuspected drug deal in Hamilton, South
OL,14,FLanarkshire, in August 2024.
OL,16,FSmith, 35, was partly pulled into the
OL,17,Fcar by the pair as Mills Jnr drove off
OL,18,Fand then hauled along before being left
OL,19,Fin a heap on the ground.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
