OL,3,GNEWSAFather and son jailed for dragging
OL,4,A'terrified' police officer along road
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe officer suffered extensive injuries
OL,7,F- including a fractured skull and a
OL,8,Fsignificant traumatic brain injury -
OL,9,Fand fears he will never be able to
OL,10,Freturn to frontline policing.
